        "answer": {
          "short": "i $\\frac{4}{25}$\n\nii $\\frac{2}{15}$",
          "worked": "i With replacement:\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{both blue})&=\\frac{4}{10}\\times\\frac{4}{10}\\\\P(\\text{both blue})&=\\frac{4}{25}\\end{align*}$$\nii Without replacement:\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{both blue})&=\\frac{4}{10}\\times\\frac{3}{9}\\\\P(\\text{both blue})&=\\frac{2}{15}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
